The times are hard and fear conquers the hearts of mankind. With the plague on the loose, [[Imperial Guard]]s are outnumbered more and more every day. The [[Am Fah]], a street gang plotting against the imperialists and responsible for several murders and robberies, sees the plague, which turned the city into a place of terror, as a blessing. The Am Fah worship this plague, using these idols as the symbols of their worship, and are even willing to infect themselves to spread the plague's influence further.

