=== Farming ===
====[[Wajjun Bazaar]]====
Start from the [[The Marketplace]] or [[Nahpui Quarter (outpost)|Nahpui Quarter]], and farm the Am Fah along the eastern corridor. Click [[:Image:Plague Idol Wajjun Bazaar farming map.jpg|here]] to see the short path or [[:Image:Plague Idol Farm Extended.png|here]] to see the extended path.

The quest [[Deactivating P.O.X.]] spawns a number of Am Fah foes as well as Jade Brotherhood allies, making it a good place to farm.

